  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC Phase-Out Management Plan (Stage II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The HPMP Stage II for Suriname is aiming to support the country to achieve complete phase-out of HCFCs under the Montreal Protocol by 2030. Stage II will seek to implement activities to phase out remaining HCFC consumption based on the promotion of natural refrigerant use.</narrative>
  </description>
